      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 540002882,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I've never used VLD so can't really comment, although it does look interesting.\n\nOne concern is that it seems semi-abandoned, no code changes since Nov. 2017 and the docs only mention VS2015 support, there is an open [issue](https://github.com/KindDragon/vld/issues/75) for VS2019 support which also mentions crashes on Win 10.\n\nIf it works for Tomasz then it's fine by me, I probably wouldn't document it yet (apart from code comments) until we get more experience with it.\n\nAs to the changes, couldn't they be added to WS_LINK_FLAGS via CMake [generator expressions](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/manual/cmake-generator-expressions.7.html) to only be set for the Debug build, this would make it less intrusive in CMakeLists.txt.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6621762,
            "username": "graham.bloice",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Graham Bloice",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/8730bfac2267cb97ff1f8187d285f244745a03a783055c8fd6fcd679bfa71c6e?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/graham.bloice"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-03-29T11:26:08.743Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-03-29T13:58:44.412Z",
