        {
          "id": 540166941,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Visual Leak Detector 2.5.1 works fine for me with Visual Studio 2019 Version 16.9.2.\n\nFor generator expressions, we would have to use [LINK_OPTIONS](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/prop_tgt/LINK_OPTIONS.html) instead of [LINK_FLAGS](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/prop_tgt/LINK_FLAGS.html). The problem with switching to LINK_OPTIONS is that we would have to change minimum CMake version to 3.13 for all targets (it is 3.5 for non-WIN32).",
